**Data model:** `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/Owner.java` — `registrationDate` (line 100, getter 125) and `birthDate` (line 103) are the `LocalDate` sources for every derivation above. (Owner is a large JavaBean; its methods are all trivial getters/setters plus pet-collection helpers — not relevant to complexity of the derivations.)

