## 5. Related test files

**`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/test/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/acceptance/AcceptanceTest.java`** — the only concrete test class; currently just the pending `coreReturnsFiscalYear` test above. Black-box: creates an owner via `POST /api/owners`, reads back via `GET /api/owners/{id}`.

**`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/test/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/acceptance/AcceptanceBase.java`** — the harness (abstract base). Relevant to your task, it re-implements the same algorithms the production helpers use, so a fiscal-year test can assert exact values:
- `toBusinessDay(LocalDate)` at lines 268-274 — mirror of `BusinessDay.rollForward` (weekend + `HOLIDAYS` skip).
- `HOLIDAYS` set at lines 240-242 — same five 2026 dates as `BusinessDay.HOLIDAYS`.
